<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Dean Foods Q2 cut, Q3 raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Dean Foods Q2 cut, Q3 raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Wednesday it lowered its FYQ2 EPS estimate on Dean Foods Co to $0.42 from $0.47 to reflect lower-than-expected prices of butterfat.</p>
<p>--It raised its FYQ3 EPS estimate to $0.43 from $0.38, noting that the lower butterfat prices and simultaneous drop in raw milk prices soon will begin to help ice cream and fluid milk margins.</p>
<p>--EVEREN's full-year estimates remain unchanged at $1.85 for FY97 and $2.05 for FY98.</p>
<p>--Dean Foods was trading at 28-3/8, up 1/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
